WEBVTT

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:12.700
♬ Whenever you're feeling a little down ♬

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:19.210
♬ Stand tall,
and let your voice be heard ♬

00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:25.420
♬ This song has always been by my side ♬

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:24.210
Wow...

00:00:24.210 --> 00:00:26.380
What a pretty voice.

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:30.930
♬ And showed me the light ♬

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:35.760
♬ Let's hold hands ♬

00:00:36.850 --> 00:00:39.690
My name is Kanon Shibuya!

00:00:39.690 --> 00:00:41.270
My birthday is May 1st.

00:00:41.270 --> 00:00:43.770
I live with my dad, mom, little sister,

00:00:43.770 --> 00:00:45.650
and a Japanese scops owl named Roundy!

00:00:45.650 --> 00:00:49.400
My favorite foods are baked apples,
tomatoes, and Hamburg steak!

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:54.530
My dream is to get into the music program
at Yuigaoka Girls' High School...

00:00:55.490 --> 00:00:59.040
...and make everyone smile with my song!

00:00:59.040 --> 00:01:02.960
I-I'm from Gaien West Middle School...
My name is Kanon Shibuya.

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:05.210
All right. Let's have you sing your song.

00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:07.050
Y-Yes, ma'am...

00:01:16.850 --> 00:01:18.220
Shibuya-<i>san</i>?

00:01:19.890 --> 00:01:21.350
Shibuya-<i>san</i>?!

00:01:25.480 --> 00:01:26.980
This sucks!

00:01:26.980 --> 00:01:29.280
This wouldn't be so hard if I could
actually sing when it mattered.

00:01:29.280 --> 00:01:30.860
Sis!

00:01:30.860 --> 00:01:33.030
Sis!

00:01:33.030 --> 00:01:35.820
Come on! If you're up here, answer me!

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:36.660
Meh.

00:01:36.660 --> 00:01:38.200
What kind of response is that?!

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:40.450
Today's your entrance ceremony, isn't it?!
You're going to be late!

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:41.910
Yeah, yeah.

00:01:41.910 --> 00:01:43.290
Hurry up!

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:44.710
Yup.

00:01:48.130 --> 00:01:49.800
I'm leaving.

00:01:49.800 --> 00:01:52.010
Can I get a "good morning"?

00:01:52.010 --> 00:01:52.840
Morning.

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:54.260
No breakfast?

00:01:54.260 --> 00:01:55.140
Nope.

00:01:58.680 --> 00:02:01.060
I'll see you later, Roundy.

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:04.190
Kanon!

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:06.690
You look great in that uniform.

00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:09.690
I don't.

00:02:11.240 --> 00:02:13.780
Is she still upset about
not getting accepted?

00:02:13.780 --> 00:02:15.700
She's sensitive.

00:02:16.870 --> 00:02:17.950
Okay.

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:26.960
Now I won't have to hear anything.

00:03:15.550 --> 00:03:16.880
Kanon-<i>chan</i>!

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:18.300
Morning.

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:20.800
Spring break just flew by, huh?

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:26.520
Really? I couldn't wait
to go to Yuigaoka myself.

00:03:26.520 --> 00:03:28.350
Me, too!

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:31.610
Man, everyone who gets into
the music program is amazing.

00:03:31.610 --> 00:03:34.190
And you look great in those uniforms, too.

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:35.820
Thanks! You do, too, Kanon-<i>chan</i>!

00:03:35.820 --> 00:03:37.910
The general curriculum
uniforms are cute, too!

00:03:37.910 --> 00:03:38.950
Y-You think so?

00:03:38.950 --> 00:03:40.450
It suits you!

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:44.410
Sorry! I didn't mean anything by it!

00:03:44.410 --> 00:03:47.000
Oh, don't even worry about it.
What can ya do?

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:48.580
I'm not even worried about it anymore.

00:03:48.580 --> 00:03:52.210
Not to mention the general curriculum
should be less stressful.

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:55.840
I never thought you wouldn't
get into the music program...

00:03:55.840 --> 00:03:58.760
I've always loved
your singing, Kanon-<i>chan</i>.

00:04:00.180 --> 00:04:05.520
Oh. That cat's been coming by
my place a lot lately. Well, bye!

00:04:07.890 --> 00:04:09.270
Thanks.

00:04:09.270 --> 00:04:11.650
You're a real lifesaver, you know that?

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:28.750
♬ Whenever you're feeling a little down ♬

00:04:28.750 --> 00:04:34.670
♬ Stand tall,
and let your voice be heard ♬

00:04:37.460 --> 00:04:40.340
♬ This song has always been by my side ♬

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:45.470
♬ And showed me the light ♬

00:04:48.310 --> 00:04:52.730
♬ Let's hold hands ♬

00:04:57.480 --> 00:05:00.480
This Yet Unknown Feeling

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:05.990
I have no trouble singing at all
when it doesn't matter.

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:08.160
Magnificent!

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:09.120
Wh-What?!

00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:11.290
Your voice is like
a gift from the heavens!

00:05:11.290 --> 00:05:12.540
Now that I've heard your voice...

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:14.500
Wait, Chinese?!

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:19.340
Please, sing with me!

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:22.680
As school idols!

00:05:22.680 --> 00:05:24.300
You're way too close!

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:27.640
<i>Ni hao! Xiè xiè! Xiǎolóngbāo! Zàijiàn!</i>

00:05:27.640 --> 00:05:28.970
She's so scary!

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:30.810
Please wait!

00:05:34.860 --> 00:05:36.320
Huh? Wha?

00:05:36.320 --> 00:05:40.690
Is she an exchange student?
All because I decided to sing!

00:05:40.690 --> 00:05:42.570
What are you doing?

00:05:42.570 --> 00:05:43.410
Chi-<i>chan</i>!

00:05:43.410 --> 00:05:44.620
Heyo.

00:05:44.620 --> 00:05:46.950
Some weird girl's after me.

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:49.750
Huh? I don't see anyone.

00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:51.790
Thank goodness.

00:05:51.790 --> 00:05:54.960
Chi-<i>chan</i>, you look great
in the music program uniform.

00:05:55.830 --> 00:05:59.800
You got in, so make sure
you do your best with dancing.

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:03.180
Yeah. You're still singing, too, right?

00:06:03.180 --> 00:06:06.300
Me? I...

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:10.890
"1st Entrance Ceremony"
"Yuigaoka Girls' High School"

00:06:07.810 --> 00:06:10.810
I thought I'd try something new!

00:06:10.810 --> 00:06:13.810
Remember? I told you
before our entrance exams.

00:06:13.810 --> 00:06:17.980
If I didn't make it, that was
going to be it. That I was giving up.

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:19.730
But...

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:23.450
I still want to hear you sing, Kanon-<i>chan</i>.

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:29.410
So, hey. I'm starting a part-time job
at a <i>takoyaki </i>place today.

00:06:29.410 --> 00:06:31.370
Come visit me if you can.

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:38.380
It brings me great joy
to welcome all of you

00:06:38.380 --> 00:06:40.630
as the very first class at our school.

00:06:40.630 --> 00:06:43.170
I'm sure that many of you are aware

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:47.680
that this school used to be
Jingu Music School.

00:06:47.680 --> 00:06:50.510
I hope that we can continue
the long tradition of music here,

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:53.390
especially with our music students,

00:06:53.390 --> 00:06:56.350
and that you will all brilliantly
take flight someday.

00:06:56.350 --> 00:07:02.230
I'm from Gaien West Middle School.
My name is Kanon Shibuya. Um...

00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:05.240
The girl with the magnificent voice...

00:07:05.240 --> 00:07:09.700
M-My dream is to own a cat someday...

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:12.410
I'm Sumire Heanna. Pleasure.

00:07:12.410 --> 00:07:15.040
It's nice to meet you!
I've come from Shanghai!

00:07:15.040 --> 00:07:18.670
My name is Keke Tang!
My mother is Japanese!

00:07:18.670 --> 00:07:22.920
By the way, are any of you
interested in school idols?

00:07:22.920 --> 00:07:27.260
I would love to be school idols
with all of you!

00:07:29.680 --> 00:07:33.060
Huh? Girl with the magnificent voice?

00:07:33.060 --> 00:07:35.810
Girl with the magnificent voice?

00:07:36.730 --> 00:07:40.520
I guess she's in my class.
This is gonna be rough.

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:43.100
"Yuigaoka Concert Band"
"Join the Tennis Team"
"Looking for members"

00:07:41.940 --> 00:07:43.530
Let's see...

00:07:43.530 --> 00:07:46.990
Concert band...
Tennis team... Drama Club...

00:07:46.990 --> 00:07:53.450
Are any of you interested in
school idols? Anyone?

00:07:52.740 --> 00:07:59.080
"Let's be school idols"

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:56.750
I would love to be school idols
with all of you!

00:07:56.750 --> 00:07:59.000
Why don't we give it a try?

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:02.540
Does anyone want to become
a school idol with me?

00:08:03.800 --> 00:08:07.380
The girl with the magnificent voice...

00:08:07.380 --> 00:08:08.880
Yikes, yikes!

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:10.260
Please wait!

00:08:10.260 --> 00:08:11.260
Yikes, yikes! Yikes, yikes!

00:08:11.260 --> 00:08:13.060
--Please wait!
--Yikes!

00:08:13.060 --> 00:08:14.470
Wait...

00:08:17.270 --> 00:08:18.600
Why?!

00:08:18.600 --> 00:08:20.980
I want to be a school idol!

00:08:20.980 --> 00:08:22.940
I want to be a school idol with you!

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:25.730
I have no idea what you're saying!

00:08:25.730 --> 00:08:31.490
Oh, excuse me. When I get excited,
I forget to speak Japanese.

00:08:31.490 --> 00:08:36.120
It's nice to meet you.
I'm Keke. Keke Tang.

00:08:36.120 --> 00:08:38.210
I'm... Kanon Shibuya.

00:08:38.210 --> 00:08:39.370
Kanon-<i>san</i>!

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:40.210
Yes?

00:08:40.210 --> 00:08:45.090
Your singing is so magnificent!
And so, would you...

00:08:40.540 --> 00:08:44.420
"Let's be school idols"

00:08:45.090 --> 00:08:48.220
...like to be school idols with me?

00:08:48.220 --> 00:08:52.890
School idols? Like those idols...
but at school?

00:08:52.890 --> 00:08:56.350
I came to Japan because
I wanted to become a school idol!

00:08:56.350 --> 00:08:58.600
Your singing is magnificent, Kanon-<i>san</i>!

00:08:58.600 --> 00:09:01.900
So please! Let's be school idols together!

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:05.900
Sorry, I'm gonna pass.

00:09:05.900 --> 00:09:07.280
But why?

00:09:07.280 --> 00:09:09.530
I'm not cut out for it.

00:09:09.530 --> 00:09:13.660
That's not true. Anyone can
become a school idol.

00:09:13.660 --> 00:09:15.530
And you're cute, Kanon-<i>san</i>.

00:09:15.530 --> 00:09:16.240
Huh?

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:17.790
You're very cute.

00:09:17.790 --> 00:09:20.620
I-I don't think I'm... cute.

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:22.880
You love singing, don't you?

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:28.550
I don't hate it...

00:09:28.550 --> 00:09:31.510
I know you love it! I can tell!

00:09:31.510 --> 00:09:33.930
So let's do this together!

00:09:33.930 --> 00:09:37.770
Please use your magnificent voice
and become a school idol with me!

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:41.560
Are you the one handing out these fliers?

00:09:44.860 --> 00:09:49.230
Who gave you permission to hand them out?
Did you ask the director?

00:09:49.230 --> 00:09:51.740
Oh... I'm sorry...

00:09:51.740 --> 00:09:56.120
I just wanted to become a school idol...

00:09:56.120 --> 00:09:57.530
A school idol?

00:09:57.530 --> 00:09:59.240
Is that not allowed?

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:03.620
I heard that this school was very
passionate about music. That's why I--

00:10:03.620 --> 00:10:05.830
It's because we're so
passionate about music

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:08.050
that we can't just allow you
to run around doing this.

00:10:08.050 --> 00:10:09.380
Hey, hang on.

00:10:09.380 --> 00:10:12.670
Do you really have to say it like that?

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:15.050
She just came here from overseas.

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:18.890
Who are you? Are you also
involved with this student?

00:10:18.890 --> 00:10:22.980
Involved? I mean...
I guess I can't say that I'm not...?

00:10:22.980 --> 00:10:25.520
In that case, I'll tell you, as well.

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:29.070
Music is extremely
important at our school.

00:10:29.070 --> 00:10:33.570
So I ask that you refrain from doing
such frivolous things without permission.

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:36.490
How do you know she's being frivolous?

00:10:36.490 --> 00:10:40.290
You need to actually explain
why school idols aren't allowed.

00:10:40.290 --> 00:10:43.160
You shouldn't just yell at her like that,
saying they're bad.

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:46.540
It's because they're not worthy.

00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:50.590
Not worthy? What?
How are school idols not worthy?

00:10:50.590 --> 00:10:53.840
They would not bring
any merit to our school.

00:10:53.840 --> 00:10:56.090
How can you be so sure of that?!

00:10:57.640 --> 00:10:59.760
What about you?

00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:03.480
Do you also want to be a school idol?

00:11:05.520 --> 00:11:07.150
I...

00:11:09.770 --> 00:11:12.320
Anyway, please go home for the day.

00:11:12.320 --> 00:11:15.150
Make sure you don't get in the way
of the music students.

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:19.280
Kanon-<i>san</i>, thank you.

00:11:19.280 --> 00:11:21.620
No, don't even worry about it.

00:11:21.620 --> 00:11:25.660
I actually didn't get into
the music program.

00:11:26.710 --> 00:11:31.170
Even though I love to sing. I guess I just
don't have the talent for it.

00:11:32.130 --> 00:11:34.720
So it's all over. No more singing for me.

00:11:38.680 --> 00:11:40.260
Kanon-<i>san</i>!

00:11:40.470 --> 00:11:42.220
"Let's be school idols"

00:11:44.360 --> 00:11:46.650
Is it really over though?

00:11:46.650 --> 00:11:48.000
Huh?

00:11:48.000 --> 00:11:53.930
Is there ever an end to doing your best
for something that you love?

00:11:58.150 --> 00:12:00.950
Love Live! Superstar!!

00:11:58.480 --> 00:12:00.620
Love Live! Superstar!!

00:12:02.580 --> 00:12:04.700
Here you go.

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:09.210
Cocoa!

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:13.920
The chocolate is upping me warm.

00:12:13.920 --> 00:12:14.760
You got that backwards...

00:12:14.760 --> 00:12:16.420
Just shoo already.

00:12:16.420 --> 00:12:17.760
Fine.

00:12:18.720 --> 00:12:22.930
So, hey... I really don't think
I'm cut out to be an idol.

00:12:22.930 --> 00:12:26.560
That's not true! Anyone can
become a school idol!

00:12:26.560 --> 00:12:27.510
Idol?!

00:12:27.510 --> 00:12:28.190
You?!

00:12:28.190 --> 00:12:30.730
Shut up! Quit eavesdropping!

00:12:30.730 --> 00:12:33.480
Your singing voice is
magnificent, Kanon-<i>san</i>!

00:12:33.480 --> 00:12:37.400
When I met you this morning,
I knew you were the one!

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:41.200
You can tell just by looking at me,
can't you? I'm not idol material.

00:12:41.200 --> 00:12:44.870
That's not true!
You're very cute, Kanon-<i>san</i>!

00:12:44.870 --> 00:12:45.740
Cute?!

00:12:45.740 --> 00:12:46.450
Her?!

00:12:46.450 --> 00:12:49.460
For crying out loud, stop eavesdropping!

00:12:50.460 --> 00:12:52.460
Can I ask you something?

00:12:54.460 --> 00:12:55.550
No singing?

00:12:55.550 --> 00:12:56.460
You know,

00:12:56.460 --> 00:13:00.800
there are bands and groups where people
other than the vocalists don't sing.

00:13:00.800 --> 00:13:01.890
Maybe something like that.

00:13:01.890 --> 00:13:05.810
Well, groups like that do exist...

00:13:05.810 --> 00:13:09.180
Do you not want to sing, Kanon-<i>san</i>?

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:12.900
It's not that I don't want to sing...
It's more I can't?

00:13:12.900 --> 00:13:15.520
But you were. With your magnificent voice.

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:20.030
Well, I can sing in those situations...

00:13:21.950 --> 00:13:25.370
Okay, fine. I guess I have to tell you.

00:13:25.370 --> 00:13:29.370
When it really comes
down to it, I can't sing.

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:31.370
My voice just won't come out.

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:32.880
But...

00:13:34.670 --> 00:13:37.840
The first time was in grade school.

00:13:55.230 --> 00:13:56.150
Kanon-<i>chan</i>!

00:13:56.150 --> 00:13:58.150
The song started!

00:14:03.160 --> 00:14:06.160
Kanon-<i>chan</i>!

00:14:04.320 --> 00:14:06.160
Are you okay?!

00:14:06.160 --> 00:14:11.040
Ever since, my voice won't come out
when it really matters.

00:14:11.040 --> 00:14:13.670
I was in choir in middle school,

00:14:13.670 --> 00:14:15.670
but I couldn't do any competitions.

00:14:15.670 --> 00:14:19.130
And when I tried to
apply for this school...

00:14:19.130 --> 00:14:21.880
Even though you love singing?

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:25.180
Yup, even though I love singing.

00:14:26.260 --> 00:14:30.180
I'm so sorry. I had no idea and I...

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:31.980
No, don't worry about it.

00:14:31.980 --> 00:14:32.850
But...

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:35.310
I'm going to help you out, Keke-<i>chan</i>.

00:14:35.310 --> 00:14:36.730
I want to help.

00:14:36.730 --> 00:14:39.940
So if I can find anyone that seems like
they're interested in school idols,

00:14:39.940 --> 00:14:41.150
I'll let you know.

00:14:41.150 --> 00:14:42.530
Really?

00:14:42.530 --> 00:14:43.820
Of course!

00:14:43.820 --> 00:14:46.740
Because I love singing!

00:14:47.570 --> 00:14:49.200
Kanon-<i>san</i>...

00:14:50.240 --> 00:14:52.450
I'll start looking tomorrow.

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:55.330
If there's anything you
don't understand, let me know.

00:14:55.330 --> 00:14:57.250
I'll help you out any way I can.

00:14:57.250 --> 00:14:58.540
Okay...

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:02.300
School idols?

00:15:02.300 --> 00:15:06.220
Yeah. I'm trying to find people
that might be interested.

00:15:06.220 --> 00:15:08.930
It's totally fine to look...

00:15:08.930 --> 00:15:12.180
But I'm not sure you'll find anyone
in our music program.

00:15:12.180 --> 00:15:13.640
Because anyone in our music program...

00:15:13.640 --> 00:15:16.520
Be it singers, people who
play instruments, or dancers...

00:15:16.520 --> 00:15:22.230
They all concentrate on their one thing,
so they'd prioritize that.

00:15:22.230 --> 00:15:23.240
I see...

00:15:23.240 --> 00:15:27.240
Not to mention, there's a bunch of people
who don't like school idols.

00:15:27.240 --> 00:15:30.950
Especially Hazuki-<i>san</i>,
who says they don't belong at our school.

00:15:30.950 --> 00:15:35.290
Hazuki... Wait, does she have
a ponytail like this?

00:15:35.290 --> 00:15:37.420
You know her?

00:15:37.420 --> 00:15:39.920
She's apparently the daughter
of Hana Hazuki,

00:15:39.920 --> 00:15:42.800
the person who established our school.

00:15:42.800 --> 00:15:44.550
I see...

00:16:01.110 --> 00:16:02.520
That voice...

00:16:08.610 --> 00:16:09.660
I'm home.

00:16:09.660 --> 00:16:10.660
Oh.

00:16:10.660 --> 00:16:13.370
Did you go to your new friend's place?

00:16:13.370 --> 00:16:15.830
No, I went to see Chi-<i>chan</i>.

00:16:15.830 --> 00:16:19.290
Ah, I heard she's been
working hard with dance.

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:23.170
Here, this is for everyone.

00:16:37.520 --> 00:16:39.440
School idols, huh?

00:16:39.440 --> 00:16:40.730
Nanami-<i>chan </i>was a no...

00:16:40.730 --> 00:16:43.650
Sorry, I'm really terrible at singing.

00:16:43.650 --> 00:16:45.230
Yae-<i>chan </i>is also a no...

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:47.070
I have something else I want to do.

00:16:47.070 --> 00:16:49.410
A nope from Kokono-<i>chan</i>, too...

00:16:52.990 --> 00:16:55.040
I see.

00:16:55.040 --> 00:16:57.790
I had no luck either.

00:16:57.790 --> 00:17:00.290
But I haven't gone around
to the other classes yet.

00:17:00.290 --> 00:17:03.880
There might be someone in
the music program that'd be interested.

00:17:03.880 --> 00:17:05.460
But...

00:17:07.970 --> 00:17:09.260
It's nothing.

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:11.840
Right?

00:17:11.840 --> 00:17:13.300
Yeah.

00:17:13.300 --> 00:17:14.930
Um...

00:17:14.930 --> 00:17:16.100
Yes?

00:17:16.100 --> 00:17:19.770
Y-You're Sumire Heanna-<i>chan</i>
that's in our class, right?

00:17:19.770 --> 00:17:24.190
I know this is sudden, but do you have
any interest in s-school idols?

00:17:24.190 --> 00:17:26.360
Maybe you could...

00:17:27.740 --> 00:17:30.860
Just who do you think I am?!

00:17:30.860 --> 00:17:32.410
Eek.

00:17:32.410 --> 00:17:33.910
I'm sorry...

00:17:33.910 --> 00:17:35.910
Oh, no worries!

00:17:39.290 --> 00:17:40.620
Hazuki-<i>san</i>.

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:42.290
She's keeping an eye on us.

00:17:42.290 --> 00:17:46.710
There are so many people who like music,
so I thought we could figure it out.

00:17:46.710 --> 00:17:49.720
But finding idols might be rough.

00:17:57.720 --> 00:18:00.520
I guess they really are hard to find.

00:18:00.520 --> 00:18:03.100
Let's go around some
other classes tomorrow.

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:05.560
I'm sure we'll find some people
who are interested.

00:18:05.560 --> 00:18:06.730
Kanon-<i>san</i>...

00:18:06.730 --> 00:18:09.740
We're going the same way
at least part way. Let's go!

00:18:09.740 --> 00:18:11.400
Kanon-<i>san</i>!

00:18:12.780 --> 00:18:14.620
I...

00:18:14.620 --> 00:18:18.200
I was hoping you'd change your mind...
about being a school idol.

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:22.370
I didn't want to trouble you,
so I hesitated asking...

00:18:22.370 --> 00:18:25.670
But I really...

00:18:25.670 --> 00:18:29.550
I really want to be a school idol
with you, Kanon-<i>san</i>!

00:18:30.920 --> 00:18:34.640
But I told you yesterday...

00:18:34.640 --> 00:18:36.510
I can't sing.

00:18:36.510 --> 00:18:39.430
If I can't sing,
I'm just going to hold you back.

00:18:39.430 --> 00:18:41.230
You love singing, Kanon-<i>san</i>!

00:18:41.230 --> 00:18:44.230
Showing love and support
for people who love to sing...

00:18:44.230 --> 00:18:46.730
That's the kind of person
I want to be a school idol with!

00:18:46.730 --> 00:18:47.610
I can't, though...

00:18:47.610 --> 00:18:48.520
Please!

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:49.400
I really can't...

00:18:49.400 --> 00:18:50.400
That's not tru--

00:18:50.400 --> 00:18:51.650
It is, though!

00:18:56.610 --> 00:18:59.200
"Let's be school idols"
"Let's do this together!?"

00:18:59.330 --> 00:19:01.200
S-Sorry...

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:07.840
It's just such a let down...
when I can't sing when I need to.

00:19:07.840 --> 00:19:11.420
I let down everyone around me,
and most importantly,

00:19:11.420 --> 00:19:13.420
I let myself down!

00:19:13.420 --> 00:19:16.640
And I don't want that anymore!

00:19:19.350 --> 00:19:20.720
I'll support you!

00:19:20.720 --> 00:19:25.520
I promise I won't give up
until you can sing, Kanon-<i>san</i>!

00:19:25.520 --> 00:19:27.860
So please, won't you give it a try?

00:19:27.860 --> 00:19:31.820
Could you try starting over with me?

00:19:38.190 --> 00:19:41.450
"Let's be school idols"
"Let's do this together!?"

00:19:40.370 --> 00:19:41.620
Is this what I want?

00:19:43.830 --> 00:19:47.330
There's someone who says
they love my singing...

00:19:48.580 --> 00:19:51.800
Someone who says
they want to sing with me...

00:19:53.130 --> 00:19:55.630
So is this really what I want?

00:19:58.340 --> 00:20:00.680
Am I going to be able to live with this?

00:20:21.740 --> 00:20:23.330
Kanon-<i>san</i>...

00:20:29.960 --> 00:20:33.840
I've felt this way
ever since I was little...

00:20:33.840 --> 00:20:37.840
I love to sing. I want to sing forever.

00:20:37.840 --> 00:20:42.760
As long as I'm singing,
I can fly high up into the sky.

00:20:42.760 --> 00:20:46.560
All my troubles, my wayward feelings...

00:20:46.560 --> 00:20:50.230
I can turn all of that into
my strengths and be positive.

00:20:53.690 --> 00:20:56.440
I want to always be singing.

00:20:59.740 --> 00:21:01.200
I knew it.

00:21:01.200 --> 00:21:07.450
♬ Let's shout out, "I love you!" ♬

00:21:05.620 --> 00:21:07.450
I still really love singing!

00:21:07.450 --> 00:21:11.500
♬ What else can we do but dream? ♬

00:21:20.430 --> 00:21:25.810
♬ I was so frustrated
with my flawed self ♬

00:21:25.810 --> 00:21:31.190
♬ So much, that I even
