00:21:36.610 --> 00:21:42.660
♬ And wanted to do my best was trembling ♬

00:21:42.660 --> 00:21:45.120
♬ The wind playfully blows
through the intersection ♬

00:21:45.120 --> 00:21:47.870
♬ And my skirt dances along with it ♬

00:21:47.870 --> 00:21:50.540
♬ Each time, I feel butterflies ♬

00:21:50.540 --> 00:21:59.300
♬ Because this time,
I know I can change for sure ♬

00:22:00.510 --> 00:22:05.390
♬ I can't lie to the feelings ♬

00:22:05.390 --> 00:22:07.260
♬ That I love so much anymore ♬

00:22:07.260 --> 00:22:09.430
♬ (It's okay to cry!) ♬

00:22:09.430 --> 00:22:11.230
♬ I'm going to chase after them ♬

00:22:11.230 --> 00:22:16.230
♬ I'll turn every stumble
I take into wings ♬

00:22:16.230 --> 00:22:18.030
♬ I can fly, yeah! ♬

00:22:18.030 --> 00:22:20.400
♬ (I can hear it now) ♬

00:22:20.400 --> 00:22:25.030
♬ The future forecast, hallelujah! ♬

00:22:34.250 --> 00:22:40.420
♬ No matter how high that wall is ♬

00:22:40.420 --> 00:22:42.340
♬ I'm going to surpass it ♬

00:22:42.340 --> 00:22:47.140
♬ I can't lie to the feelings ♬

00:22:47.140 --> 00:22:49.100
♬ That I love so much anymore ♬

00:22:49.100 --> 00:22:51.230
♬ (It's okay to cry!) ♬

00:22:51.230 --> 00:22:53.060
♬ I'm going to chase after them ♬

00:22:53.060 --> 00:22:58.020
♬ I'll turn every stumble
I take into wings ♬

00:22:58.020 --> 00:22:59.860
♬ I can fly, yeah! ♬

00:22:59.860 --> 00:23:02.240
♬ (I can hear it now) ♬

00:23:02.240 --> 00:23:07.910
♬ The future forecast, hallelujah! ♬

00:23:07.910 --> 00:23:10.080
"Love Live! Superstar!!"

00:23:12.870 --> 00:23:20.300
♬ Let's believe, hallelujah! ♬

00:23:26.470 --> 00:23:29.430
Kanon-<i>san</i>! That was magnificent!

00:23:31.430 --> 00:23:33.430
Wait...

00:23:33.430 --> 00:23:34.940
Was I able to sing?!

00:23:36.510 --> 00:23:40.980
No School Idols Allowed?!

